# ::tok Lawyer Sarit Golan, a member of the Haifa City Council, responded: "The evidence and the difficult findings emerging from the report require the opening of a criminal investigation against all those involved in the use of the investigative audit consultant to conduct investigations, some of which are doubtful as to whether they are permitted by law in the manner in which they were carried out, and in particular the investigations concerning the council member from the opposition to the mayor and former senior employees."
